SUMMARY:Trusted AI starts with Fabric: Unified Real Time Intelligence and 
 IQ
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nIn the fifth session in the FabCon 
 and SQLCon recap series\, we will review how Fabric Real-Time Intelligence
  and shared context from Fabric IQ can enable teams and AI to reason in th
 e language of your business and operate in tandem to drive measurable impa
 ct on your business objectives.
